{"surface":"இல்லோர்","parts":[{"text":"இல்லோர்","lemma":"இல்லோர்","gloss":"those who have nothing"}],"gloss":"those who have nothing"},{"surface":"வாழ்க்கை","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்க்கை","lemma":"வாழ்க்கை","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"life"},{"surface":"இரவினும்","parts":[{"text":"இரவினும்","lemma":"இரவு","gloss":"even than begging"}],"gloss":"even than begging"},{"surface":"இளிவெனச்","parts":[{"text":"இளிவெனச்","lemma":"இளிவெனல்","gloss":"saying it is disgraceful"}],"gloss":"saying it is disgraceful"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சொல்லிய","parts":[{"text":"சொல்லிய","lemma":"சொல்லுதல்","gloss":"spoken"}],"gloss":"spoken"},{"surface":"வன்மை","parts":[{"text":"வன்மை","lemma":"வன்மை","gloss":"strength"}],"gloss":"strength"},{"surface":"தௌியக்","parts":[{"text":"தௌியக்","lemma":"தௌிய","gloss":"clearly"}],"gloss":"clearly"},{"surface":"காட்டிச்","parts":[{"text":"காட்டிச்","lemma":"காட்டுதல்","gloss":"having shown"}],"gloss":"having shown"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சென்றனர்","parts":[{"text":"சென்றனர்","lemma":"செல்லுதல்","gloss":"they went"}],"gloss":"they went"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழ்தல்","gloss":"may you live"}],"gloss":"may you live"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"யென்றும்","parts":[{"text":"யென்றும்","lemma":"என்றும்","gloss":"always"}],"gloss":"always"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கூற்றத்","parts":[{"text":"கூற்றத்","lemma":"கூற்று","gloss":"Yama/death"}],"gloss":"Yama/death"},{"surface":"தன்ன","parts":[{"text":"தன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"கொலைவேல்","parts":[{"text":"கொலைவேல்","lemma":"கொலைவேல்","gloss":"killing spear"}],"gloss":"killing spear"},{"surface":"மறவர்","parts":[{"text":"மறவர்","lemma":"மறவர்","gloss":"warriors"}],"gloss":"warriors"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆற்றிருந்","parts":[{"text":"ஆற்றிருந்","lemma":"ஆற்றிருத்தல்","gloss":"staying on the path"}],"gloss":"staying on the path"},{"surface":"தல்கி","parts":[{"text":"தல்கி","lemma":"தல்குதல்","gloss":"lingering"}],"gloss":"lingering"},{"surface":"வழங்குநர்ச்","parts":[{"text":"வழங்குநர்ச்","lemma":"வழங்குநர்","gloss":"travelers"}],"gloss":"travelers"},{"surface":"செகுத்த","parts":[{"text":"செகுத்த","lemma":"செகுத்தல்","gloss":"slain"}],"gloss":"slain"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"படுமுடை","parts":[{"text":"படுமுடை","lemma":"படுமுடை","gloss":"stench of fallen corpse"}],"gloss":"stench of fallen corpse"},{"surface":"பருந்துபார்த்","parts":[{"text":"பருந்துபார்த்","lemma":"பருந்துபார்த்தல்","gloss":"vultures watching"}],"gloss":"vultures watching"},{"surface":"திருக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"திருக்கும்","lemma":"இருத்தல்","gloss":"staying"}],"gloss":"staying"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெடுமூ","parts":[{"text":"நெடுமூ","lemma":"நெடுமூது","gloss":"long and ancient"}],"gloss":"long and ancient"},{"surface":"திடைய","parts":[{"text":"திடைய","lemma":"இடை","gloss":"expanse"}],"gloss":"expanse"},{"surface":"நீரில்","parts":[{"text":"நீரில்","lemma":"நீரில்","gloss":"waterless"}],"gloss":"waterless"},{"surface":"ஆறே","parts":[{"text":"ஆறே","lemma":"ஆறு","gloss":"path indeed"}],"gloss":"path indeed"}]}],"literal":"Those who destroy what exists are not considered as living / The life of those who have nothing is more disgraceful than begging, thus / clearly showing the strength of what they spoke, / they went, may you live, my friend, always / Warriors with killing spears like Yama / staying on the path, lingering, slaying travelers, / where vultures watch for the stench of fallen corpses, / in the long, ancient, waterless expanse of the path.","translation":"Those who destroy their existing wealth are not counted among the living. The life of the poor is more disgraceful than begging. Clearly demonstrating the truth of these words, he has departed, my friend, may you live! He travels through the long, ancient, waterless desert path, where fierce warriors with deadly spears like Yama lie in wait to slaughter travelers, and vultures watch for the stench of fallen corpses.","modern":"தோழியே, நீ வாழ்க! 'தம்மிடம் உள்ள பொருளை அழித்து வாழ்பவர்கள் உயிரோடு இருப்பவர்களாகக் கருதப்பட மாட்டார்கள்; வறியவர்களின் வாழ்க்கை இரந்து கேட்பதை விடவும் இழிவானது' என்று தான் கூறிய கொள்கையின் வலிமையை நமக்குத் தெளிவாகக் காட்டிவிட்டுத் தலைவர் சென்றுவிட்டார். எமனுக்கு ஒப்பான கொலைத்தொழில் புரியும் வேலேந்திய மறவர்கள் வழியில் தங்கி, அவ்வழியே செல்வோரைக் கொன்று குவிக்க, அதனால் உண்டாகும் பிண நாற்றத்தை எதிர்பார்த்துப் பருந்துகள் காத்திருக்கும், நீண்ட, பழமையான, நீர் இல்லாத பாலைநில வழியில்தான் அவர் சென்றுள்ளார்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend about the hero's departure to the arid desert to earn wealth. She recalls how the hero believed that living without wealth or destroying one's existing wealth is worse than begging. To prove his determination and fulfill his duty of earning wealth, he has gone. The dangerous desert path is described with vivid, terrifying imagery—fierce bandits like Yama waiting to kill travelers, and vultures watching for corpses. This harsh landscape reflects the heroine's inner anguish and fear for her lover's safety, while also highlighting the extreme difficulty of his quest for wealth. Key words include 'உள்ளது' (what exists), 'இல்லோர்' (the poor), 'வன்மை' (strength/determination), and 'நீரில் ஆறு' (waterless path).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}